---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const lastUpdated = '2026-07-25';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy — JapChi"
  description="JapChi Privacy Policy: how we handle your data with Firebase auth, cloud stats, and no ads."
>
  <article aria-labelledby="privacy-heading">
    <!-- Draft notice -->
    <div class="draft-notice" role="alert" aria-live="polite">
      ⚠️ <strong>DRAFT — Pending Legal Review.</strong> This document has not yet
      been reviewed by legal counsel. Do not treat it as a final, binding privacy
      policy. Last updated: <time datetime={lastUpdated}>{lastUpdated}</time>.
    </div>

    <p class="section-label">Legal</p>
    <h1 id="privacy-heading">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">
      JapChi ("we", "us", or "our") operates the JapChi iOS application and the
      website at <a href="https://playjapchi.online">playjapchi.online</a>. This
      Privacy Policy explains what data we collect, why we collect it, and how
      we protect it.
    </p>
    <p class="meta">
      Effective date: <time datetime={lastUpdated}>{lastUpdated}</time><br />
      Contact: <a href="mailto:privacy@playjapchi.online">privacy@playjapchi.online</a>
    </p>

    <nav aria-label="Privacy policy sections" class="toc">
      <h2 id="toc-heading">Contents</h2>
      <ol aria-labelledby="toc-heading">
        <li><a href="#section-identity">1. Who We Are</a></li>
        <li><a href="#section-data-collected">2. Data We Collect</a></li>
        <li><a href="#section-authentication">3. Authentication (Firebase)</a></li>
        <li><a href="#section-game-stats">4. Cloud-Stored Game Statistics</a></li>
        <li><a href="#section-no-ads">5. No Advertising</a></li>
        <li><a href="#section-no-sale">6. No Sale of Personal Data</a></li>
        <li><a href="#section-third-parties">7. Third-Party Services</a></li>
        <li><a href="#section-data-retention">8. Data Retention &amp; Deletion</a></li>
        <li><a href="#section-children">9. Children's Privacy</a></li>
        <li><a href="#section-rights">10. Your Rights</a></li>
        <li><a href="#section-changes">11. Changes to This Policy</a></li>
        <li><a href="#section-contact">12. Contact Us</a></li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <section aria-labelledby="section-identity">
      <h2 id="section-identity">1. Who We Are</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <p>
          JapChi is an independent iOS application. For privacy inquiries, contact
          us at <a href="mailto:privacy@playjapchi.online">privacy@playjapchi.online</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="section-data-collected">
      <h2 id="section-data-collected">2. Data We Collect</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <p>We collect only the data necessary to provide the game experience:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Account identifiers</strong> — a unique user ID generated by Firebase Authentication, linked to your chosen sign-in method.</li>
          <li><strong>Display name / email</strong> — provided by your Apple, Google, or Facebook account at sign-in, used solely to personalise your experience.</li>
          <li><strong>Game statistics</strong> — puzzle attempt counts, scores, streaks, and timestamps, stored in Firebase Firestore.</li>
          <li><strong>Device information</strong> — iOS version and device model, collected by Firebase automatically for crash reporting.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do <strong>not</strong> collect precise location, contacts, photos, health data, or any other sensitive category.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="section-authentication">
      <h2 id="section-authentication">3. Authentication (Firebase)</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <p>
          JapChi uses <strong>Firebase Authentication</strong> (provided by Google LLC)
          to manage sign-in. We support three providers:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Sign in with Apple</strong> — Apple may provide a
            private relay email address. We store only what Apple sends us.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Sign in with Google</strong> — Google provides your name and
            email address. We store only what Google sends us.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Sign in with Facebook</strong> — Facebook provides your name and
            email address. We store only what Facebook sends us.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Firebase Authentication data is processed under Google's
          <a href="https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">
            Firebase Privacy and Security documentation
          </a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="section-game-stats">
      <h2 id="section-game-stats">4. Cloud-Stored Game Statistics</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <p>
          Your puzzle results, streaks, and daily scores are stored in
          <strong>Firebase Firestore</strong>, allowing you to resume your
          progress across devices. This data is associated with your Firebase
          user ID and is not publicly visible to other players unless you
          explicitly share a result.
        </p>
        <p>
          Firebase Firestore is operated by Google LLC and governed by the
          <a href="https://cloud.google.com/terms/data-processing-addendum" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">
            Google Cloud Data Processing Addendum
          </a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="section-no-ads">
      <h2 id="section-no-ads">5. No Advertising</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <p>
          JapChi contains <strong>no advertisements</strong>. We do not integrate
          any advertising SDK, affiliate network, or sponsored content. There is
          no ad-tracking identifier (IDFA) usage.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="section-no-sale">
      <h2 id="section-no-sale">6. No Sale of Personal Data</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <p>
          We do <strong>not</strong> sell, rent, trade, or otherwise transfer your
          personal data to third parties for their own commercial purposes. We do
          not share data with data brokers or analytics resellers.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="section-third-parties">
      <h2 id="section-third-parties">7. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <p>We use the following third-party services, each with their own privacy policies:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Google Firebase</strong> (Authentication, Firestore, Crashlytics) — <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google Privacy Policy</a></li>
          <li><strong>Apple Sign In</strong> — <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Apple Privacy Policy</a></li>
          <li><strong>Google Sign In</strong> — <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google Privacy Policy</a></li>
          <li><strong>Facebook Login</strong> — <a href="https://www.facebook.com/policy.php" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Facebook Data Policy</a></li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not integrate any other third-party analytics, tracking, or advertising libraries.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="section-data-retention">
      <h2 id="section-data-retention">8. Data Retention &amp; Deletion</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <p>
          We retain your account and game statistics for as long as your account
          is active. You may request deletion of your account and associated data
          at any time by emailing
          <a href="mailto:privacy@playjapchi.online">privacy@playjapchi.online</a>.
          We will process deletion requests within 30 days.
        </p>
        <p>
          Crash logs collected by Firebase Crashlytics are automatically purged
          after 90 days per Google's standard retention schedule.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="section-children">
      <h2 id="section-children">9. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <p>
          JapChi is not directed to children under the age of 13 (or the
          equivalent minimum digital age of consent in your jurisdiction). We
          do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you
          believe a child has provided us with personal information, please
          contact <a href="mailto:privacy@playjapchi.online">privacy@playjapchi.online</a>
          and we will delete it promptly.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="section-rights">
      <h2 id="section-rights">10. Your Rights</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <p>
          Depending on your jurisdiction you may have rights to access, correct,
          delete, or port your personal data, and to object to or restrict certain
          processing. To exercise any of these rights, contact us at
          <a href="mailto:privacy@playjapchi.online">privacy@playjapchi.online</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="section-changes">
      <h2 id="section-changes">11. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will
          revise the "effective date" at the top of this page. Continued use of
          JapChi after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="section-contact">
      <h2 id="section-contact">12. Contact Us</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <p>
          For any privacy-related questions or requests:
          <a href="mailto:privacy@playjapchi.online">privacy@playjapchi.online</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  article { max-width: 52rem; }

  .page-intro {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem;
    max-width: 42rem;
  }

  .meta {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .toc {
    background: var(--color-bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .toc h2 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .toc ol {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 0.2rem 1rem;
  }

  .toc a {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  section { margin-top: 2.5rem; }
  section h2 { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
</style>

